@startuml
[*] --> NavigateHomepage
NavigateHomepage --> DisplayProjects : select project
DisplayProjects --> ViewPhotosOrVideos : view photos or videos
ViewPhotosOrVideos --> DisplayProjectInfo : display project info
DisplayProjectInfo --> ChooseUpdateOrApplication : choose update or application
ChooseUpdateOrApplication --> ViewUpdates : view updates
ChooseUpdateOrApplication --> OpenApplicationForm : open application form
OpenApplicationForm --> SubmitJobApplication : submit job application
SubmitJobApplication --> CheckSubmittedApplications : check submitted applications

@enduml
